John Novak <jsn@cegt201.bradley.edu> wrote:
)But what are the benefits of blessing a spellbook?  Does it let
)you cast blessed versions of the spells, or are the spells easier
)to memorize, or what?

	If the spellbook is blessed, you will always succeed in memorizing
the spell. (Of course, if you're low-INT, you may not be able to *cast*
it, but nobody ever promised you a rose garden.) Conversely, an attempt
to memorize from a cursed spellbook will always fail. So watch out for 
those spellbooks from the bones piles.

